"5. Check character details before generating. Keep the app in the foreground while Anima works; loading and image generation can take several minutes. Stop is cooperative and may finish the current phase first." = "5. 產生圖像前請檢查角色細節。Anima 執行時請將應用程式保持在前景；載入和產生可能需要幾分鐘。停止可能需要等待目前階段結束。";
